    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'Morphs have a "Zero" side and a "One" side.


    These are separate morphs
    and both sides are optional.


    The Zero side is applied when the dna value
    is less than 0.5.


    The One side is applied when the dna value is more than
    0.5.


    The "Ears Morph" and "Alien Head" only have the "One" side which is
    why the slider only applies for the right half in this demo scene.'
