    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Blendshapes can be used by adding 'Blendshape DNA Converters' to a 'Converter
    Controller'. \n\n'Converter Controllers' convert DNA names into changes to an
    avatar and can be assigned to races or slots. (In this example 'BlendshapeDNAConverterController'
    has been assigned to the 'MaleEarsMorph_Slot')\n\nThe 'names' a controller can
    use are defined in the DynamicDNAAsset (in this case BlendNamesDynamicDNA')\n\nHow
    the value for a name is interpreted is controlled by the 'DNAEvaluator' you see
    in an entry in the controller's 'Blendshape DNA Converters'\n\nIn this case both
    the 'Ears Morph' and the 'Alien Head Morph' are using 'ZeroZeroOne' evaluation,
    which means the slider does not start having any effect until its value is greater
    than 0.5\n"
